{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47889","headline":"宴柳毅诗 一 · 洞庭龙君","name":"宴柳毅诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大天苍苍兮大地茫茫，人各有志兮何可思量。\n狐神鼠圣兮薄社依墙，雷霆一发兮其孰敢当。\n荷贞人兮信义长，令骨肉兮还故乡，永言惭愧兮何时忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"洞庭龙君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}